					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: OFFSET\n\nThe offset parameter is the value added to the output signal.\nIn this example we use an offset of 0.5 to unipolar Perlin Generators.\nThe unipolar setting ensures a range of 0 to 0.5\nAdding 0.5 offset gives us a range of 0.5 to 1.0, which is a good range for bright colors using the Color from RGB node."
					}
				},
